WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:04.000
In Shortcuts, find the personal shortcut 記録する (Record).

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Tap the play button at the top right of the card.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Enter the description and amount, for example コーヒー450円 (coffee, 450 yen).

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Tap Done and check the saved amount.

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.333
Open Kotori to review the pending entry.
